    "updated_at": "2018-08-29T21:08:42Z",
    "body": "Not really, but the CSSWG generally prefers shorter names so `legend` is probably  a good working name for now. Once this draft has stabilized a bit more, I think it should be reviewed by the CSSWG and the wider CSS community on www-style@w3.org so that there is consensus about the CSS property names/values used in this spec.",
